emrys-filter provides CMake targets:

    find_package(EmrysFilter 0.1 CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE EmrysFilter::EmrysFilter)

It needs a C++23 compiler (GCC 14, Clang 21, or MSVC 19.4x) and links Eigen3::Eigen from the
eigen3 port. Its docs, examples, and agent skills are under share/EmrysFilter.
